<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Itausa to announce restructuring.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Itausa to announce restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Grupo Itausa on Tuesday will announce a restructuring plan, involving its insurer Itau Seguros and its bank Banco Itau, a bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>Banco Itau president Roberto Setubal will hold a news conference at 1430 local time/1330 EDT/1730 GMT to discuss the restructuring.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
